  "acceptanceRules": [
    "The live manifest tableScopeChange must pin this exact v5 file hash and payload seal, while this policy directly pins immutable v4; activeTableSpecifications remains exactly 131.",
    "Every added row must reproduce the exact ownerSession, complete producer set, exact declared readConsumers and non-empty nonReplaceability reason.",
    "Every declared reader must include the table in readPlan.tables and projectionTuple.physicalSources and expose at least two exact durable direct field bindings under tenant-safe joins; qualified lineage is accepted only through the closed one-prefix grammar.",
    "Anonymous Listening uses the exact signed-credential PEP profile without authenticated-principal capability coupling; protected submit admits no unsigned duplicate fields and no broker/public outbox.",
    "Crypto erasure remains the exact multi-phase owner-local lease/KMS/TX2 saga; a fictitious one-database transaction is forbidden.",
    "Contingent and succession public revisions forbid client effectiveTo; persisted effective_to is NULL-only and the response boundary is server-derived with no latest fallback.",
    "Manifest-to-v2 and sealed-v2-to-v1 Listening authority edges are validated separately; a duplicate manifest predecessor hash is forbidden."
  ],
